The site's UI components and tooling are copied from The Lab by ethPandaOps
(https://github.com/ethpandaops/lab), licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. These
files come from it, some adapted (lab's Ethereum-specific parts removed, osrs-evals' navigation,
crumbs and radii added):

- src/components/Elements, Forms, Layout (but not the Sidebar's and ThemeToggle's look), Navigation,
  Overlays (but Overlays/Tooltip, written here in their style), Feedback, DataTable and Lists/Table
- src/components/Charts/chartChrome.ts and src/components/Charts/Sparkline (the chart chrome)
- src/providers, src/contexts and src/hooks/useTheme and useThemeColors
- src/utils/color.ts and echarts-theme.ts
- the structure of src/styles/base.css and src/styles/utilities.css (the layout utilities and
  keyframes) and the shape of src/index.css
- eslint.config.js, .prettierrc, knip.ts, vite.config.ts, the tsconfig files and
  pnpm-workspace.yaml

The theme is the site's own and not from lab: the palette, data hues, type and radii in
src/styles/tokens.css ("ink": neutral greys, ink for what is interactive, no brand hue; Inter and
JetBrains Mono), and the chrome: the sidebar's look and wordmark
(src/components/Layout/Sidebar), the header bar and mobile header (src/routes/__root.tsx) and the
two-theme toggle (src/components/Layout/ThemeToggle).
